WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.540
You have a lot of people working

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.130
across the country very hard

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.640
to educate people in each state

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:09.480
about what they need to do to register,

00:00:09.480 --> 00:00:13.210
how they need to vote,
it's really important.

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:16.150
and I thought it might be a nice treat

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.620
for some of these
hardworking young people,

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.453
but I thought it might be fun

00:00:20.453 --> 00:00:23.250
if we surprised a couple of them

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:24.520
with a little Zoom bomb,

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:27.650
and it might lift their spirits right now

00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:28.534
because we know they're working so hard.

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:30.120
Would you like to do that?

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:32.140
That sounds like a great idea.

00:00:32.140 --> 00:00:34.030
Hopefully after us,

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:37.590
we just have so many people
who don't stay silent

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.857
when they're in the face of injustice.

00:00:39.857 --> 00:00:43.225
When there are people in
power who are doing wrong.

00:00:43.225 --> 00:00:45.050
(bell ringing)

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:46.450
Everybody, excuse me.

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:48.083
I just want to say hello.

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.770
Conan O'Brien here,

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:53.270
I know the hard work that you're doing.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.120
I mean, I'm really impressed
with when we all vote.

00:00:56.120 --> 00:00:59.440
I wanted to pop in and just very quickly

00:00:59.440 --> 00:01:02.220
thank you all for all
the work you're doing,

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:03.200
and we're gonna show this

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.740
on my late night program tonight.

00:01:05.740 --> 00:01:07.689
I wish you'd cleaned up, some of you.

00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:08.714
(laughing)

00:01:08.714 --> 00:01:10.150
Would it have killed you to clean up?

00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:11.420
I hope this is okay.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:13.170
I wanted to say hello,

00:01:13.170 --> 00:01:14.780
and if you're cool with it,

00:01:14.780 --> 00:01:15.860
is it okay I have a friend

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:16.980
who just wanted to say a quick hi,

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:18.290
is that all right?

00:01:18.290 --> 00:01:19.460
You just hold on a sec.

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:20.332
Yeah.
Here we go.

00:01:20.332 --> 00:01:21.165
(bell rings)

00:01:21.165 --> 00:01:22.490
(group exclaims)

00:01:22.490 --> 00:01:23.323
Surprise.

00:01:27.001 --> 00:01:28.299
Oh my goodness.

00:01:28.299 --> 00:01:30.353
(laughing)

00:01:30.353 --> 00:01:32.754
What are you guys talking about?

00:01:32.754 --> 00:01:33.822
Changing the world.

00:01:33.822 --> 00:01:36.630
Mrs. Obama I was telling them,

00:01:36.630 --> 00:01:39.518
I wish some of them had
cleaned their rooms.

00:01:39.518 --> 00:01:40.843
Wow, wow, wow.

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:44.270
Your rooms look perfectly clean.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:46.110
I'm looking at everyone.

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:48.545
You guys look like you're doing good.

00:01:48.545 --> 00:01:50.060
Hi,

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:52.290
I know that this group
is working really hard

00:01:52.290 --> 00:01:56.290
on getting the vote out and doing so much.

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:57.500
There's one woman here

00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.820
who is about to get out
of her car and do stairs.

00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:04.880
Our team's a little bit
out of shape from COVID

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:05.980
being quarantined all this time.

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.410
So we have a lot of stairs to make up.

00:02:08.410 --> 00:02:11.720
Oh my God. Conan, you need to do that.

00:02:11.720 --> 00:02:12.970
What are you talking about?

00:02:12.970 --> 00:02:15.380
I mean, what makes you think I'm not

00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.610
in perfect physical condition, Mrs. Obama?

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.440
Your hair is a little too perfect.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.890
It's not look how's that?

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:25.140
Don't you like Conan's
hair, you guys? I mean-

00:02:25.140 --> 00:02:26.400
We love Conan's hair.

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.030
Thank you very much, I love it

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:30.590
during this incredibly tense time

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.130
in historic time in our nation.

00:02:33.130 --> 00:02:36.580
We have the former first
lady talking to you guys

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:38.940
who are working so hard
to get the vote out,

00:02:38.940 --> 00:02:41.341
and the conversation has gone to my hair.

00:02:41.341 --> 00:02:42.245
(laughing)

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:47.000
I think that is absolutely
ridiculous and absurd, Mrs.Obama,

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.360
I know she feels the same way I do

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:50.010
that we're just really
grateful to you guys

00:02:50.010 --> 00:02:51.874
for doing so much hard work.

00:02:51.874 --> 00:02:54.810
Very impressive that you guys are managing

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.730
to stay so focused on
getting people registered

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.470
and to get them informed.

00:02:59.470 --> 00:03:02.950
And you're doing your classes online

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:06.620
and staying involved in your
teams and running stairs.

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:10.630
And you know, I mean, it's just amazing,

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:14.020
but it's work that is so needed.

00:03:14.020 --> 00:03:16.630
It is so important for you guys

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.790
to get your generation and your peers

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:21.760
and your family members
focused on this election.

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:24.600
The work that you're doing
couldn't be more important

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:26.760
and I'm so proud of you.

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:28.650
And it's like, when I see your faces,

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:30.180
that makes me wanna work harder

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.010
because I think you all deserve leadership

00:03:33.010 --> 00:03:34.547
that reflects who you all are.

00:03:34.547 --> 00:03:37.380
And you guys are good and smart

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.990
and kind and open and caring.

00:03:39.990 --> 00:03:43.280
And you deserve leadership
that reflects that,

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.310
so keep working hard please.

00:03:46.310 --> 00:03:48.020
And we love you so much.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.687
Conan aren't they? I mean,

00:03:49.687 --> 00:03:51.020
duh.

00:03:51.020 --> 00:03:53.000
Conan's speechless-

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.860
Yeah. I'm very impressed with these kids.

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:59.560
Again, I think some of the
rooms could be cleaner,

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:00.950
but I'm gonna shut up about it.

00:04:00.950 --> 00:04:03.680
Well, thank you all very, very much

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:07.020
and I leave the final
sign off to Mrs. Obama.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:10.363
Oh, you guys keep up the great work,

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:14.380
study hard, stay safe, wear your masks,

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:15.230
I'm gonna be your mother.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.653
Eat your vegetables,

00:04:17.779 --> 00:04:19.240
No. Okay.

00:04:19.240 --> 00:04:20.840
and give your families my love

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:21.810
and your classmates.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:25.150
Tell them to vote, Vote,
vote, vote, vote, vote.

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:26.290
Okay?

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.089
Let's have a cheer for Mrs Obama

00:04:28.089 --> 00:04:30.756
(all cheering)

